  "notes": "RFC 6455 §1.3's canonical test vector: key 'dGhlIHNhbXBsZSBub25jZQ==' -> accept 's3pPLMBiTxaQ9kYGzzhZRbK+xOo=' (SHA-1 of key+the RFC 6455 GUID, base64-encoded) — this independently validates the server's accept-key computation against the spec, not just against itself. The server must ignore inbound text frames entirely (no close, no command execution) even though the payload ('stop') looks like a real command."
